# CUDA runtime for faster-whisper (CTranslate2 4.x: CUDA 12 + cuDNN 9) in the GPU image
# (Dockerfile VARIANT=cuda). torch stays CPU-only: only Whisper and the person detector
# run on the GPU.
nvidia-cublas-cu12
nvidia-cudnn-cu12==9.*
# onnxruntime with CUDA, for our own perception's person detector (own_perception.py).
# It takes the place of the CPU build faster-whisper brings (the Dockerfile uninstalls
# that one first). 1.26 is the last one built for CUDA 12, which Whisper's CTranslate2
# uses (1.27 on PyPI needs CUDA 13); its CUDA provider also loads these.
onnxruntime-gpu==1.26.0
nvidia-cuda-runtime-cu12
nvidia-cufft-cu12
nvidia-curand-cu12
